1️⃣ UUPS Proxy (Real World Way)
🔹 How UUPS works (quick vibe check)

Logic contract controls upgrades

Proxy is super lightweight

Cheaper gas than Transparent

Upgrade logic lives inside implementation




🧠 How you deploy (important)

